            "id": "20261028A033CQ00",
            "title": "【电报解读】美国向最大核电运营商提供50亿美元融资，机构称核电产业链正迎来“燃料涨价+资本扩张+需求增长”的三重共振，这家公司实现了核电领域产品的技术突破",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Om3UwBaDw1DIyvEWJlQn76tlp9HqVh7tBtVGXo9F4WrqEAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261028A033CQ00",
            "author": "千锤百炼",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-28 08:37:19",
            "description": "<div id=\"article-content\"></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
